[00:24.45]You found me in the spring time
{"你在春日里寻到我"}
[00:27.20]I'll seize the opportunity
{"我会抓住这机遇"}
[00:30.20]Blossom in the sunlight
{"在阳光下绽放"}
[00:32.52]I hope that you will wait for me
{"希望你会等候我"}
[00:35.45]You walked into my sightline
{"你闯入我的视线"}
[00:38.20]And filled my eyes with color
{"用色彩盈满我双眼"}
[00:41.17]All I could remember
{"我所能记得的"}
[00:43.42]Is that no one could match your allure
{"是无人能及你的魅力"}
[00:45.47]'Cause I need you to need me
{"因为我需要你依赖我"}
[00:48.20]I'll be myself and be free
{"我将做自己得自由"}
